{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！\n乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7/22 発売\n42ndシングル「是非に及ばず」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日は、MV公開\nテレ東音楽祭 2026夏にてTV初披露でした❤️‍🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVはこちらから🤘🏻\nhttps://youtu.be/ogAufBgPpBk"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobwkhyla.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobtwuUVs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツインカチモリ💛🖤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVも音楽番組での披露も共通して\n自分たちの中にある強さをしっかり出していかないと観ている皆様に伝わらないんだろうなと。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生を楽しむ\n何にも左右されないような逞しく強い女性をイメージして披露しています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さらに披露を重ねるごとに色が付いていくんだなと思うと楽しみで仕方ないです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今まで出会えなかった自分、\nまた新しいグループの形を教えていただくきっかけをいただいたと思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46はまだこんなにも新しい可能性を秘めたグループです！\n一人一人のパフォーマンスの魅力も、乃木坂46というグループ全体の良さも伝わるシングル期間になりますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アンダー楽曲の初披露も神奈川公演でありましたね〜！\n42ndシングル、楽しみにしていてください🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobObYQ1w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このシングル期間、沢山このポーズするんだろうな〜🤘🏻\nみんなも一緒にやろうね😏🤘🏻❤️‍🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobir4fep.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さっちゃんさんの3️⃣ポーズです！（ひなの）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い後輩です、にやけちゃった🤭\nうるみとひなのの可愛い写真沢山撮らせてもらった☺️💘"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobosOOcV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "横浜アリーナに行くと必ずヨコアリくんと写真を撮る人こと菅原です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全国ツアーもスタートしています🌻\n次は北海道です！！\n待っててねー！🩵"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「是非に及ばず」\nhttps://youtu.be/4eTwcw3g2jY"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ビリヤニ」\nhttps://youtu.be/rKoaFS9M3JA"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "コール動画が公開されています！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろん！\nLIVEは好きな楽しみ方をして欲しいけれど、、\n更により良いLIVEを一緒に作るために皆様のパワーをもっともっといただきたいです！！\n欲張りでごめんね😏"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーで、最っ高に楽しくタオルあげる皆さんを見られるの楽しみにしてます😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では、ここらへんで\nまた書きます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の一曲。\n優しさについて / 羊文学"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026.6.29"}], "source": "official"}